{"id":"436796","name":"枸杞玉米粒圆子羹","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"","cover":"images/436796/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"60克"},{"name":"玉米粒","amount":"50克"},{"name":"枸杞","amount":"20克"}],"sub":[{"name":"冰糖","amount":"适量"},{"name":"水淀粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：糯米粉。","img":"images/436796/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"玉米粒。","img":"images/436796/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"枸杞。","img":"images/436796/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"冰糖。","img":"images/436796/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"水淀粉。","img":"images/436796/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"将枸杞用热水泡一下，待用。","img":"images/436796/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"在大碗中倒入60克糯米粉。","img":"images/436796/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"逐步加入清水和成糯米团。","img":"images/436796/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"随后，取一点糯米团搓成一个个圆子，待用。","img":"images/436796/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"接着，将冰糖搁入清水锅中。","img":"images/436796/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"煮开，煮至融化。","img":"images/436796/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"然后，下入圆子，合入玉米粒煮开，煮至圆子浮起。","img":"images/436796/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"最后，倒入水淀粉勾芡，搁入泡好的枸杞搅匀，即成。","img":"images/436796/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：汤锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}